# Security and human approval

- Enforce security in application controls, not prompts.
- Least privilege; tool allowlists; tenant/company isolation; fail closed on consequential ops.
- Require James/owner approval for client delivery, real invites, resend/reissue, deletes, production config, financial/contractual actions, and A3+ agent actions.
- Do not weaken pilot invitation authorization or approval checklists.
- Never commit or print secrets.

See `HUMAN_APPROVAL_STANDARD.md` and `AGENT_SECURITY_STANDARD.md` under `owner-ops/docs/peacemakers-operating-system/`.
